{
  "id": "ch02_strand_registry",
  "chapter": "ch02",
  "location": "loc_decc_ration",
  "trigger": "Reach the registry desk.",
  "speakers": [
    "strand",
    "dell",
    "narrator"
  ],
  "start": "start",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "The DECC floor: folding tables, kerosene heaters, a big whiteboard. DAYS OF STORES: 140.",
      "next": "s1"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "Next. Name, sector, household, medical needs. Short answers help us both.",
      "next": "s2"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "speaker": "dell",
      "text": "Adele Kowalczyk. Sector 4. Me and my son. He's Type 1.",
      "next": "s3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "Insulin-dependent minor. That's priority tier two. I can issue a card.",
      "next": "s4"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "Lineworker, it says. Ms. Kowalczyk, we will need you. Remember I said that.",
      "next": "s5"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "One more question. Mandatory. Any household on your block with fuel or food over thirty days?",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Ray Brekke. Generator, diesel.",
          "next": "report",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "any": [
                {
                  "flag": "ch01_ray_traded",
                  "eq": true
                },
                {
                  "flag": "ch01_knows_ray_siphoned",
                  "eq": true
                },
                {
                  "flag": "ray_mentioned_cody",
                  "eq": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No.",
          "next": "deny"
        },
        {
          "text": "Why do you need names?",
          "next": "why"
        },
        {
          "text": "Is that number real? 140 days?",
          "next": "numbers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "why",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "Because hoarding kills more people than hunger, this early. That's the data.",
      "next": "s5b"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5b",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "It's not punishment. It's arithmetic. Anyone?",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Ray Brekke. Generator, diesel.",
          "next": "report",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "any": [
                {
                  "flag": "ch01_ray_traded",
                  "eq": true
                },
                {
                  "flag": "ch01_knows_ray_siphoned",
                  "eq": true
                },
                {
                  "flag": "ray_mentioned_cody",
                  "eq": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No.",
          "next": "deny"
        },
        {
          "text": "Is that number real? 140 days?",
          "next": "numbers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "report",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "Thank you. That fuel will run a dialysis unit. Truly.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "set": "ch02_reported_ray",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "add": "rep_authority",
          "value": 1
        },
        {
          "trust": "strand",
          "delta": 2
        },
        {
          "give": "priority_card",
          "qty": 1
        },
        {
          "give": "ration_card",
          "qty": 1
        },
        {
          "set": "ch02_registered",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "report2"
    },
    {
      "id": "report2",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "She writes RAY BREKKE on a clipboard list. Your name goes next to it: SOURCE.",
      "next": "card"
    },
    {
      "id": "deny",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "Noted. Ration card. Priority cards are... short this week.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "set": "ch02_registered",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "add": "rep_authority",
          "value": 1
        },
        {
          "trust": "strand",
          "delta": 1
        },
        {
          "give": "ration_card",
          "qty": 1
        }
      ],
      "next": "deny2"
    },
    {
      "id": "deny2",
      "speaker": "dell",
      "text": "He's fifteen. He's diabetic. You said tier two.",
      "next": "deny3"
    },
    {
      "id": "deny3",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "Households that cooperate get processed first. I don't love it. It's policy.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "...Ray Brekke. Generator, diesel.",
          "next": "report",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "any": [
                {
                  "flag": "ch01_ray_traded",
                  "eq": true
                },
                {
                  "flag": "ch01_knows_ray_siphoned",
                  "eq": true
                },
                {
                  "flag": "ray_mentioned_cody",
                  "eq": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I'll find another way.",
          "next": "deny4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "deny4",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "Hospital's east wing. Dr. Ames sometimes finds ways. Next.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "quest": "q_insulin",
          "state": "update",
          "stage": "hospital"
        }
      ],
      "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "numbers",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "You look at the clipboard by her elbow. Handwritten: 41. Not 140.",
      "next": "numbers2"
    },
    {
      "id": "numbers2",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "...Lower your voice.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "[Quietly] Forty-one days.",
          "next": "quiet"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Loud] The board says 140!",
          "next": "loud"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "quiet",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "Forty-one if nothing comes. Things might come. Panic comes for sure.",
      "next": "quiet2"
    },
    {
      "id": "quiet2",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "You'll keep it. Because you know what that line does with 41.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "set": "ch02_strand_truth",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "trust": "strand",
          "delta": 2
        }
      ],
      "next": "quiet3"
    },
    {
      "id": "quiet3",
      "speaker": "dell",
      "text": "And when it's day 40?",
      "next": "quiet4"
    },
    {
      "id": "quiet4",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "Then I'll have been wrong in public instead of right in a riot. Card.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "set": "ch02_registered",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "add": "rep_authority",
          "value": 1
        },
        {
          "give": "ration_card",
          "qty": 1
        },
        {
          "give": "priority_card",
          "qty": 1
        }
      ],
      "next": "card"
    },
    {
      "id": "loud",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Heads turn. A murmur ripples down the line. Two guards step closer.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "trust": "strand",
          "delta": -3
        },
        {
          "add": "rep_authority",
          "value": -1
        }
      ],
      "next": "loud2"
    },
    {
      "id": "loud2",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "Ms. Kowalczyk is confused. Stores are 140 days. Next.",
      "next": "loud3"
    },
    {
      "id": "loud3",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "You get a ration card. No priority card. Strand doesn't look at you again.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "set": "ch02_registered",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "give": "ration_card",
          "qty": 1
        },
        {
          "set": "ch02_strand_truth",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "set": "ch02_exposed_numbers",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "card",
      "speaker": "strand",
      "text": "Lakehead Memorial, east wing. Show the priority card to Dr. Ames. Next.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "quest": "q_insulin",
          "state": "update",
          "stage": "hospital"
        }
      ],
      "end": true
    }
  ]
}